        ('gs3_2017_q01', 'upsc_gs_mains', 'gs3', 2017, 'Questions are sometimes directly lifted from Yojana and Kurukshetra magazines questions have been asked e.g GSM3/: Integrated farming system is given verbatim in Kurukshetra magazine’s February issue. GSM3/” National watershed project. Answer given verbatim in Kurukshetra magazine’s November issue', 'gs3_economy', None, 10, '150 words', None, '4fb29a31de1888e6c55ca9273a03565184c229f18bfa643ddf5627fcb2b5e738', None, 0, None, 0, None, 0),
