        ('gs3_2014_q01', 'upsc_gs_mains', 'gs3', 2014, 'Read Introductions and conclusions of each chapter of vol1 of all economic surveys from onwards from http://indiabudget.gov.in/ It will help you easily assemble the introductions and conclusions, and fodder material for economy related questions', 'gs3_economy', None, 10, '150 words', None, '2679f5a37d2e22d00b8821331ef75ef6252263809064355614df10846305b227', None, 0, None, 0, None, 0),
