        ('gs3_2013_q03', 'upsc_gs_mains', 'gs3', 2013, 'Food Processing: article series on https://Mrunal.org/economy Although, it was created in when the syllabus was just introduced, so nobody had any Idea on what type of questions would be asked. So, in retrospect those articles are giving more depth compared to the type of superficial questions UPSC has asked. So, you simply glance over those articles, to have a basic idea. PHD', 'gs3_economy', None, 10, '150 words', None, '8a9619b8fe1fe646f88e097de6647580a27df9de1f2ce525c33eb93b2841081f', None, 0, None, 0, None, 0),
        ('gs3_2013_q04', 'upsc_gs_mains', 'gs3', 2013, 'In , when the Mains syllabus was newly introduced = UPSC asked some random science questions on i) FRP composite material and ii) Umpire decision review system', 'gs3_economy', None, 10, '150 words', None, 'ee9c1092fe86250d9f976feee6273231e48199929fc319e8dfbf27c94ce0e4d8', None, 0, None, 0, None, 0),
