        ('gs3_2020_q02', 'upsc_gs_mains', 'gs3', 2020, 'For Economy related theory, contemporary issues and current affairs are all summarised Mrunal economy handout . You can access them on my Unacademy course launching in mid-June . Use coupon Code Mrunal.org for extra discount! I do not make false marketing propaganda that no questions will be asked outside of that But it covers All the important topics of economy in a reasonably decent fashion So, parallely, you need not prepare the same topics from the economy books of Mishra Puri, Dutt Sundaram, Uma Kapila, Ramesh Singh and many other authors', 'gs3_infrastructure', None, 10, '150 words', None, 'dfa82d3ce7a52a5b5e4b026bc47ce120ebe7e2893a9fe0ee1ea324dac79c89a1', None, 0, None, 0, None, 0),
