        ('gs3_2021_q04', 'upsc_gs_mains', 'gs3', 2021, 'Rahul Deo Gupta 05/11/ at 7:50 am - Reply Hi! Respected Mrunal sir, Your lecture and website are very useful and helpful for me.. that you provide free of cost in your website Mrunal.org, & YouTube (#History, #Geography, #economics, and Internal Security etc) and also #Daily Current Affair. I am UPSC Aspirant ( Hindi Medium) But Your Language is very good and simple to understand since I have no fully idea about UPSC (regarding Syllabus and question asking trend) but your guidance is very very helpful for me. If i will selected then i personally wish to meet with you . Take care sir. Thank you sir', 'gs3_internal_security', None, 10, '150 words', None, 'b4db594ac69ae9e9e8682fe0fb2f27bf381780da0f7b501c322b9dac952ac537', None, 0, None, 0, None, 0),
