        ('gs3_2019_q04', 'upsc_gs_mains', 'gs3', 2019, 'Occasionally, random tough questions are asked = does not mean it’s a ‘trend’. For example, GSM3/: Kerala cyberdome project was asked in . It was a very obscure and low profile type of news item. Not easily available in the routine preparation sources. So, you shouldn’t drop all your studies and prepare a catalogue for all the security initiatives taken by individual state governments, just because one question was asked from Kerala. This is an exceptionally rare question. Not a general trend of UPSC paper', 'gs3_science_tech', None, 10, '150 words', None, 'dd817b93f235c13c6f8fb262b295ddd5314074d3086231b0234ab66f111fe8c9', None, 0, None, 0, None, 0),
